 ational learning\, graph and text mining\, recommender systems\, scalable
  data analysis\, and responsible data use. Generative AI is relevant when
  it advances data science\, not simply because a paper uses an LLM.\nAddi
 tional topics: Deep Representation Learning\, Natural Language Processing
  & LLMs\, Explainability & Interpretability\, Privacy-preserving ML\, ML 
 Systems & Infrastructure\nScope sources (2027): https://kdd2027.kdd.org/r
 esearch-track-call-for-papers/\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
URL:https://kdd2026.kdd.org/research-track-call-for-papers/
